@format 1
@id project.save-scene
@title Save named scene
@area 7. Project persistence
@entry input
@summary Capture the current window as a named scene and persist it in the scene collection.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related project.load-scene, project.export-scene

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Save scene requested <input>
- Read and validate the entered scene name @ console.PConsoleSaveHandle(...)
> capture

[capture] Capture current window <process>
- Capture tabs, layouts, exports, relays, and names under the requested scene name @ console.PConsoleSaveHandle(...)
> persist

[persist] Save scene collection <storage>
- Add or replace the named scene and persist the collection @ scene.LSceneSave(...)
- Rebuild and select the scene list entry @ console.PConsoleSaveHandle(...)
> result

[result] Scene saved <output>
= The named scene can be loaded in this and future sessions.
